# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore policy
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated model outputs (figs/, tables/, audit_outputs/, reports/, RESULTS.md)
# are DELIBERATELY TRACKED. They are the reviewable record of what the model
# produced at each commit, which matters more here than a clean `git status`
# after a run. Regenerate with `python3 run_all.py`.
#
# Only genuinely machine-local or bulk-derived files belong below.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

